  "description": "Silly physics-based forklift game inspired by Ghibli and Japanese car culture! Use your forklift skills in logic puzzles with many unexpected outcomes!\n\nWhen all you have is a Forklift, everything looks like a palette.\nTake a flight to Ghibli stylized JAPAN!\nLet your forklift loose on a peaceful prefecture.\n\n- Travel through the whole island and solve more than 30 puzzles to learn your story.\n- Some truck takes your parking place? No problem, you can forklift them!\n- Place Kei Cars in the right parking spots,\n- They can have alarms,\n- And might be Wired,\n- Be smart about parking gates,\n- Use illegal moves when no one sees,\n- But sometimes you can help others.\n\nMaybe they will show you how to cook Ramen? Of course, using a forklift!\n\nFeaturing:\n- An elegant forklift straight from Japan (that's you)\n- A lot of kei cars to stick on the fork,\n- A dedicated beep button (!!!)",
